    {
      "_id": 10128,
      "id": "frostbound_javelin",
      "name": "Frostbound Javelin",
      "description": "Generates an ice javelin with the power of Cryo, then directs it at enemies to deal multiple instances of <span style=\"color:#99FFFFFF\">Cryo DMG</span>.<br/>When cast, the Traveler consumes all existing stacks of <span style=\"color:#FFD780FF\">Frostglow</span>, which in turn increases the DMG dealt by this Elemental Burst. When 8 stacks of <b><span style=\"color:#FFD780FF\">Frostglow</span></b> are consumed, the number of DMG instances caused by the javelins is also increased.<br/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#FFD780FF\">Radiance: Stellar Glimmer</span></b>: DMG from the current Elemental Burst is changed to <span style=\"color:#99FFFFFF\">Cryo DMG</span> of the corresponding Stellar Glimmer reaction type.",
